  "reasoning": "The defendants organized and carried out illegal logging of forest trees belonging to a company, then sold the timber for profit. This conduct constitutes the crime of illegal cutting and destroying forest resources under Article 322 of the Criminal Law (非法采伐、毁坏森林资源罪). No other distinct crimes are indicated in the indictment.",
